        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "藩制一覧表 第九（水戸・三春）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Running header in the outer margin: Table of Domain Institutions, Fascicle 9 (Mito, Miharu). Fascicle 9 is the officials-and-military register. This is provenance, not survey data: it names the two domains whose entries open on this leaf, and it does not name Yunagaya, whose four closing columns stand on the right of the leaf."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "柱藩制一覽表第九（水戸、三春）"
      }
    ],
