        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "[Yunagaya] Acting senior councillor (gon-dai-sanji): 2 persons. This column and the three to its left stand to the right of the ○水戸藩 marker, so they close the entry that began on the facing half-leaf, where the last marker is ○湯長谷藩 and the only column under it is 大參事　欠員. The rank order confirms it: vacant senior councillor on the facing leaf, then acting senior, junior and acting junior councillors here."
